Slint Workbench

A standalone port of Raven Workbench (https://github.com/skp64-pvt01/Raven-workbench)
built with Slint (https://slint.dev/).

Slint is available under GPL-3.0-only or the Slint Royalty-free license; this
project uses the GPL-3.0-only option, so the whole work is GPL-3.0-only.
The application code follows the Raven Workbench project; the JSONC reader,
settings, schema reader and plant model are shared ports of that project's
Rust code.
